{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/burden"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Burden\/init(carryCap:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Burden\/carryCap","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Burden\/rules"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Burden\/GameContent-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Burden","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContainersDoorsAndLocks"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A world-wide "},{"code":"before(.take)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rule with no rooms of its own, added to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game’s "},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" like any other bundle:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let burden = Burden(carryCap: 100)","","var content: GameContents { burden }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The refusal is "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/handsFull","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", re-voiced like any other stock line:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"text.handsFull = \"You're holding too many things already!\""},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cap is asked early and answers last."}]},{"type":"text","text":" The rule is world scope, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it runs at stage 1, ahead of the game’s own location and item rules and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ahead of "},{"code":"take","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" itself. Not ahead of everything the game writes: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bootstrap files a game’s own rules before any module’s, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"world.before(.take)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the game declares is asked before the cap is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Stage 1 is what holds the cap for a game that replaces the verb with an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"action(.take)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of its own, and what stops a "},{"code":"before(.take)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rule that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes the world from committing its change and then being told the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player’s hands are full. A cap refusal also unwinds before the room’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"beforeEachTurn","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" upkeep runs, which is what a stage-1 refusal has always"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"done."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Running first would make “no room in your hands” answer for every refusal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"take","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" owns, which is the broad line printed over the specific one. So the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rule consults "},{"code":"take","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s own ladder before it speaks, and says nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whenever "},{"code":"take","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has a more particular answer: taking yourself, taking a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"person, taking what you already hold or wear, taking scenery, taking what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you cannot reach, taking the vehicle you are standing in. An order given to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"somebody else is not weighed at all — the cap is about the player’s hands."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A refusal the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"game"}]},{"type":"text","text":" writes in a "},{"code":"before(.take)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rule of its own is stage 3"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and so is printed only if the cap passed. Put it in a "},{"code":"reach { … }","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rule to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have it answer first."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Weight already in the player’s hands is not weighed twice. Taking something"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out of a sack they are carrying does not change the load, so the cap has no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opinion about it however full the sack is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/burden","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Player\/burden","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" weigh the way the cap weighs, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game’s own load gates — a crack too narrow for a coffin, a rope that holds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for fewer turns the more you carry — ask the same question the cap does."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Burden","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Burden","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Burden","externalID":"s:6Gnusto6BurdenV","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Burden"},"abstract":[{"text":"A carrying limit. Every takeable item has a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weight","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", and the sum","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of everything in the player’s hands — counted recursively, so a loaded sack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"brings its contents along — may not exceed "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Burden\/carryCap"},{"type":"text","text":". A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"take"},{"type":"text","text":" that would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tip the load over is refused before it happens."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameContent":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GameContent"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GameContent"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gamecontent","kind":"symbol","title":"GameContent","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A self-contained